git config --list se verify kar sakta hai.

🅰️ METHOD 1: Fresh Repo Banao & Push Karo (Recommended)
Step 1: Apne project folder me jao
CMD khol (Windows + R → cmd → Enter). Phir:

bash
cd "C:\path\to\your\project\folder"
Example:

bash
cd "C:\Users\YourName\Desktop\autonomous-recovery-planner"
💡 Tip: Agar folder path me space hai toh quotes (") zaroor lagana.

Step 2: Git initialize karo
bash
git init
Ye folder ko git repository bana dega. (.git folder ban jayega)

Step 3: Ek .gitignore file banao (bahut important)
Root folder me .gitignore naam ki file banao. Isme ye likh:

gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
venv/
env/
.env
*.db
*.sqlite3

# Node
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.env.local

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
💡 Ye file GitHub pe junk upload hone se rokegi (venv, node_modules, .env etc.)

Step 4: Saari files add karo
bash
git add .
. ka matlab hai "sab kuch current folder me"

Step 5: First commit
bash
git commit -m "Initial commit: AI Autonomous Disaster Recovery Planner"
Step 6: Branch ka naam main rakho
bash
git branch -M main
Step 7: GitHub repo ko connect karo (remote add)
bash
git remote add origin https://github.com/vishakha2121/autonomous-recovery-planner.git
Step 8: Push karo GitHub pe 🚀
bash
git push -u origin main
Popup aayega → GitHub login karega → Browser me authorize karega → ✅ Ho gaya!

🅱️ METHOD 2: Agar Repo Already Initialized Hai (Remote Exists)
Agar tu bole "remote already exists" error aaye:

bash
git remote set-url origin https://github.com/vishakha2121/autonomous-recovery-planner.git
git push -u origin main
🔐 AUTHENTICATION ISSUE (Agar Password Puche)
Aug 2021 ke baad GitHub ne password-based auth band kar diya. Ab Personal Access Token (PAT) chahiye.

PAT Kaise Banaye:
GitHub → Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Tokens (classic)

Generate new token (classic) click kar

Note: My laptop push

Expiration: 90 days (ya custom)

Scope me ✅ repo tick kar (sab kuch)

Generate token → token copy kar (ek hi baar dikhta hai!)

Use Kaise Kare:
Jab git push pe username/password puche:

Username: vishakha2121

Password: ← yahan PAT paste kar (GitHub account password nahi!)

Better: Credentials Save Karo
bash
git config --global credential.helper manager
Isse next time automatic yaad rakhega.

🔄 AGAR RE-PUSH KARNA HO (Future Updates)
Jab bhi code change kare:

bash
git status                      # dekho kya-kya change hua
git add .                       # sab add karo
git commit -m "Added feature X" # commit karo
git push                        # push karo
Bas 4 commands. Har baar.

🧯 COMMON ERRORS & FIXES
Error	Fix
fatal: not a git repository	Pehle git init chala
remote origin already exists	git remote set-url origin <url>
failed to push some refs	git pull origin main --rebase phir git push
Authentication failed	PAT use kar (password nahi)
src refspec main does not match any	Pehle git commit karna bhool gaya
large file error	.gitignore me node_modules/venv daal
LF will be replaced by CRLF	Warning hai, ignore kar sakta hai
🎯 FULL COPY-PASTE SEQUENCE (Ek Saath)
