venv/
env/
.env
*.db
*.sqlite3

# Node
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.env.local

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
💡 Ye file GitHub pe junk upload hone se rokegi (venv, node_modules, .env etc.)

