text
┌──────────────────┐
│  1. Add Infra    │  User adds servers, DBs, services
└────────┬─────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌──────────────────┐
│  2. Digital Twin │  System builds virtual replica + topology
└────────┬─────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌──────────────────┐
│  3. Simulate     │  Trigger disaster (cyberattack, outage, etc.)
└────────┬─────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌──────────────────┐
│  4. AI Planning  │  Gemini AI generates recovery strategy
└────────┬─────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌──────────────────┐
│  5. Failover     │  Execute plan → simulate recovery
└────────┬─────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌──────────────────┐
│  6. Continuity   │  Measure RTO/RPO, impact analysis
└──────────────────┘
🔌 API Endpoints
🔐 Authentication
Method	Endpoint	Description
POST	/api/auth/register	Register new user
POST	/api/auth/login	Login & get JWT
GET	/api/auth/me	Get current user
🏗️ Infrastructure
Method	Endpoint	Description
GET	/api/infrastructure	List all resources
POST	/api/infrastructure	Add new resource
GET	/api/infrastructure/{id}	Get resource
PUT	/api/infrastructure/{id}	Update resource
DELETE	/api/infrastructure/{id}	Delete resource
🌐 Digital Twin
Method	Endpoint	Description
POST	/api/twin/build	Build digital twin
GET	/api/twin/{id}	Get twin topology
GET	/api/twin/{id}/state	Get twin state
⚡ Disasters
Method	Endpoint	Description
GET	/api/disasters	List disasters
POST	/api/disasters	Create disaster
POST	/api/disasters/{id}/simulate	Simulate disaster
🧠 Recovery Plans
Method	Endpoint	Description
GET	/api/plans	List all plans
POST	/api/plans/generate	AI generate plan
GET	/api/plans/{id}	Get plan details
🔄 Simulations
Method	Endpoint	Description
POST	/api/simulations/run	Run continuity simulation
GET	/api/simulations/{id}	Get simulation result
📖 Full API docs available at http://localhost:8000/docs (Swagger UI)

🧪 Running Tests
bash
cd backend
pytest tests/ -v
